al networks to experiment semantic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":287837,"global_rank":28835,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6121},{"name":"gabe-k/pychook","owner":"gabe-k","html_url":"https://github.com/gabe-k/pychook","stars":7,"forks":2,"watchers":2,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":287822,"global_rank":28845,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6122},{"name":"FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","stars":10,"forks":3,"watchers":8,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"Run Nextflow on AWS Batch (Squared)","topics":[],"score":287815,"global_rank":28847,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6123},{"name":"vlandeiro/yamlett","owner":"vlandeiro","html_url":"https://github.com/vlandeiro/yamlett","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Yet Another ML Experiment Tracking Tool","topics":[],"score":287806,"global_rank":28851,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6124},{"name":"calebrob6/csv-joins","owner":"calebrob6","html_url":"https://github.com/calebrob6/csv-joins","stars":4,"forks":5,"wa